---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Me - Muhammad Wasif"
  description="Software engineer since 15. TypeScript, backends, and things people actually use."
>
  <main>
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      I started programming at 15. Tried a lot of languages, stuck with
      TypeScript — mostly because I like shipping things more than arguing about
      tooling.
    </p>
    <p>
      In 2019 I entered <a
        href="https://codein.withgoogle.com/archive/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">Google Code-in</a
      >, an open source competition with students from 76 countries, and was
      picked as Runner Up by <a
        href="https://fossasia.org/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">FOSSASIA</a
      > — the first Pakistani student to get there.
    </p>
    <p>
      Freelancing came next: hundreds of sites, apps and tools, a new stack
      every other month, all before I turned 19. Then Ideofuzion hired me as a
      Jr. Software Developer, and I've been building professionally since.
    </p>
    <p>
      These days I work on backends — APIs, data models, the unglamorous parts
      that decide whether a product feels fast. I care about clarity and
      maintainability, and I'm suspicious of clever code.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside work: books, art, and philosophy I only half understand.
    </p>

    <h2>On the shelf</h2>
    <ul class="books">
      <li>
        <span class="book">The Metamorphosis</span>
        <span class="author">Franz Kafka</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="book">White Nights</span>
        <span class="author">Fyodor Dostoevsky</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="book">Seerah Ibn Hisham</span>
        <span class="author">Ibn Hisham</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="book">Tafheem ul Quran</span>
        <span class="author">Abul A'la Maududi</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="poets">
      And Iqbal, Faiz and other Urdu poets on and off — never on a schedule.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  p {
    max-width: 62ch;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  p a {
    color: var(--primary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  p a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--primary);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.9rem 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .books {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 62ch;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .books li {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: padding-inline-start 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .books li:hover {
    padding-inline-start: 0.6rem;
    border-bottom-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .book {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .author {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .poets {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  }
</style>
